# Lyricist: 若山牧水 (Wakayama Bokusui) / Composer: 杉江秀 (Sugie Shū)
# Key: Bb major (?= Bb), 4/4 (<4/4>), Quarter = 96 (!= 96)
#
# Lyrics:
# 一、ぎいつこぎいつこ　お舟が通る
